1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,933
And behind the console, a small shape
under a blanket. A red toy truck on
the floor.

2
00:00:05,433 --> 00:00:07,733
A boy, asleep. Curled up. Salt on his
face.

3
00:00:08,233 --> 00:00:08,700
Kai.

4
00:00:10,233 --> 00:00:12,800
Is it a dream? You always disappear in
my dreams.

5
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,567
I'm real. I'm here. I brought snacks.

6
00:00:16,067 --> 00:00:21,600
He's older. Taller. He hugs you so
hard your ribs hurt. And nobody says
anything for a long time.

7
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:26,100
Rosa said she'd come. Every night, I
counted. A year and eleven days.

8
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:28,600
I'm here, little man. I'm here. I'm
here.

9
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:31,967
Then you notice a pot of soup. Hot.
And three bowls.

10
00:00:32,467 --> 00:00:34,267
Kai, who's been feeding you?

11
00:00:34,767 --> 00:00:36,667
Nobody. I mean... nobody.
